WEBVTT

00:26.420 --> 00:26.840
<b>m 82 222 l 159 118 327 136 364 231 332 300 146 325</b>

00:26.420 --> 00:26.840
<b>Medaka!</b>

00:27.090 --> 00:27.840
<b>m 255 63 l 290 32 404 38 432 83 404 116 286 114</b>

00:27.090 --> 00:27.840
<b>Why are you
always so mean
to Mona-chan?</b>

00:27.090 --> 00:27.840
<b>m 92 258 l 114 236 171 228 225 239 246 266 236 300 214 317 140 318 88 292</b>

00:27.090 --> 00:27.840
<b>Do your tenets
not tell you to be
nice to people?</b>

01:23.270 --> 01:29.980
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

01:23.270 --> 01:29.980
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

01:30.270 --> 01:34.280
<b>Episode 8: Halloween with Him</b>

01:34.780 --> 01:37.430
<i>Today's the day of the Halloween party.</i>

01:40.320 --> 01:43.330
<i>And my costume? Only one thing it </i>could<i> be.</i>

01:43.770 --> 01:46.460
<i>I went with the one Medaka liked, 
which was next to the mummy.</i>

01:47.060 --> 01:50.120
Mark my words, I <i>will</i> be Medaka's lockscreen!

01:57.020 --> 01:58.590
Kawai here!

01:58.900 --> 02:00.580
<i>Come on in.</i>

02:03.350 --> 02:05.380
Happy Halloween!

02:05.380 --> 02:06.640
Heya!

02:06.910 --> 02:09.900
Aww, you guys are partying already?

02:09.900 --> 02:12.070
Did you bring your costumes?

02:13.150 --> 02:16.720
I've set up a guest room. 
You can get changed there.

02:20.650 --> 02:22.660
'Kay, time to change into our costumes.

02:24.510 --> 02:27.960
What did you end up getting, Mona-senpai?

02:27.960 --> 02:31.420
Er... Please don't laugh, even if it's weird.

02:32.490 --> 02:33.630
This one.

02:35.090 --> 02:38.090
Whoa, a witch? Cute!

02:38.090 --> 02:40.720
<i>Yeesh, playing it straight.</i>

02:43.790 --> 02:46.760
<i>I'm going with the one 
Minami picked out for me.</i>

02:48.020 --> 02:49.560
Little Witch Mona-chan!

02:49.560 --> 02:52.940
I guess you would've regretted it for life 
if you'd gone with the mummy.

02:53.610 --> 02:55.190
<b>Lifelong</b>

02:53.610 --> 02:55.190
<b>Regret</b>

02:55.460 --> 02:57.710
Y-You think?

03:01.650 --> 03:03.220
Ta-dah!

03:05.370 --> 03:07.720
You stuck with that, huh, Asahi?

03:07.720 --> 03:08.480
Yeah.

03:08.480 --> 03:10.730
You look wonderful, Mona-chan.

03:12.370 --> 03:14.250
Haruno-san?!

03:15.920 --> 03:18.130
Huh? What happened to the fairy costume?

03:18.730 --> 03:21.550
On second thought, it was too embarrassing.

03:21.550 --> 03:23.390
So I went back and looked again.

03:23.730 --> 03:25.470
These are flying off the shelves.

03:25.470 --> 03:28.260
You can even hide your face.

03:28.260 --> 03:29.980
Hide too much, even.

03:29.980 --> 03:35.980
<b>Girls' Guestroom</b>

03:37.000 --> 03:39.490
Can't wait to see everyone's costumes.

03:40.790 --> 03:43.280
Crap, I forgot my hat.

03:43.280 --> 03:44.240
I'll be right there.

03:45.480 --> 03:46.660
Oh, there it is.

03:48.830 --> 03:51.770
Ain't no witch without a pointy hat.

03:56.420 --> 03:58.760
Huh? The hook came undone?

03:58.760 --> 04:01.220
Did I not do it up properly?

04:01.520 --> 04:04.880
That's weird. I can't get it right.

04:05.230 --> 04:08.560
Wait, the zip keeps goin' lower.

04:08.560 --> 04:09.220
Huh?

04:13.160 --> 04:16.400
<i>Restock the snacks. Decorate the hallways.</i>

04:16.400 --> 04:19.270
<i>Okay, I've done everything I was told to do.</i>

04:20.520 --> 04:23.060
<i>They sure know how to work a guy, sheesh.</i>

04:23.060 --> 04:25.340
<i>Costumes are fun, though.</i>

04:25.340 --> 04:27.480
<i>This one covers my whole body.</i>

04:27.480 --> 04:29.780
<i>I feel like a different person, almost.</i>

04:28.200 --> 04:30.700
<b>Girls' Guestroom</b>

04:32.520 --> 04:35.530
Good timing. Come in for a sec.

04:35.120 --> 04:35.960
<b>Girls' Guestroom</b>

04:39.000 --> 04:39.920
<i>Wait!</i>

04:39.920 --> 04:41.710
<i>This is the girls' changing room!</i>

04:43.580 --> 04:44.550
<i>I gotta bail!</i>

04:45.810 --> 04:47.220
Look.

04:47.590 --> 04:51.200
The zip came undone when 
I was trying to fix the hook.

04:51.200 --> 04:53.020
Could you zip it up for me?

04:54.940 --> 04:57.830
<i>Wh-What is this girl saying?</i>

04:59.550 --> 05:02.790
<i>I-Is she trying to tempt me again?</i>

05:03.190 --> 05:04.640
<i>I'm a guy...</i>

05:04.930 --> 05:06.800
<i>I'm a guy, you know?</i>

05:07.530 --> 05:09.150
<i>Nope, no way.</i>

05:09.150 --> 05:11.600
<i>Tokyo scary, Tokyo scary...</i>

05:11.600 --> 05:12.980
<i>Tokyo scary!</i>

05:12.980 --> 05:15.930
I'm so glad you came back, Haruno-san.

05:15.930 --> 05:18.400
I couldn't ask a guy to do this.

05:18.400 --> 05:20.460
<i>Hm? "Haruno-san"?</i>

05:20.460 --> 05:24.390
<i>Why bring her up now? What does that mean?</i>

05:24.390 --> 05:27.970
<i>I don't get it... Is she 
mistaking me for Haruno-san?</i>

05:27.970 --> 05:30.200
Come on, Haruno-san.

05:30.970 --> 05:32.260
Hurry up!

05:35.730 --> 05:39.010
<i>I totally missed my chance to say I'm a guy!</i>

05:39.010 --> 05:41.360
<i>I can't bring it up now! Not anymore!</i>

05:41.360 --> 05:45.360
<i>A-At this point, all I can do 
is get out of this before she finds out.</i>

05:46.780 --> 05:50.870
<i>Clear mind, clear spirit.</i>

05:51.320 --> 05:53.200
<i>Guh... Clear mind, clear spirit!</i>

05:53.630 --> 05:55.000
<i>Void...  Void...</i>

05:55.450 --> 06:00.570
<i>I am void... I am void...</i>

06:00.570 --> 06:03.500
<i>I am... void!</i>

06:04.980 --> 06:07.450
Thanks! That's perfect.

06:07.450 --> 06:09.880
<i>O-Okay, time to scram.</i>

06:11.450 --> 06:12.750
What's wrong?

06:17.970 --> 06:20.660
If you're having trouble breathing, 
maybe open up the hood?

06:25.650 --> 06:29.390
Wh-What are you doing in there, Kuroiwa-kun?

06:29.390 --> 06:31.370
Wait! Stay calm!

06:31.370 --> 06:33.620
The same costume as Haruno-san?

06:34.230 --> 06:35.910
<i>Wait, did I...</i>

06:36.260 --> 06:38.960
Y-You're the one who mistook me for her.

06:40.780 --> 06:43.150
Eek!

06:43.150 --> 06:45.660
B-But I didn't see! I saw nothing!

06:45.660 --> 06:48.080
Yeah, right!

06:50.360 --> 06:52.090
This should do it.

06:52.360 --> 06:55.520
Mona-chan? Is it better if I wear the hem up?

06:55.520 --> 06:58.000
There. Now I won't mistake them.

07:01.770 --> 07:04.260
Trick or treat!

07:04.260 --> 07:06.360
Here, have some treats.

07:06.360 --> 07:07.360
Yay.

07:07.850 --> 07:09.120
Mm, yum.

07:09.120 --> 07:11.450
You better leave some for us.

07:11.450 --> 07:12.670
Oh, sorry.

07:13.070 --> 07:14.270
Have a bit if you'd like.

07:14.270 --> 07:15.320
Yeah, no.

07:15.320 --> 07:17.120
I'll pass.

07:19.580 --> 07:23.780
<i>S-So what if he saw my back? 
And did the zipper?</i>

07:23.780 --> 07:26.500
<i>It ain't a big deal at all.</i>

07:26.500 --> 07:28.850
<i>Get your head back in the game.</i>

07:28.850 --> 07:30.380
<i>Gotta take that pic!</i>

07:34.980 --> 07:41.140
<i>But even if I did, 
he might delete it like last time.</i>

07:41.190 --> 07:42.520
<b></b>Delete image?

07:41.190 --> 07:42.520
<b></b>Cancel    Delete

07:41.190 --> 07:43.440
<b>Mona Kawai</b>

07:41.190 --> 07:43.440
<b>Today</b>

07:43.520 --> 07:45.490
<i>Y-Yeah, he'd totally do that.</i>

07:45.490 --> 07:48.830
<i>He doesn't realize how cutie-cute I am.</i>

07:48.830 --> 07:52.530
<i>I can't do this the normal way. I need a plan.</i>

07:53.880 --> 07:55.410
Mic test, mic test.

07:55.790 --> 07:59.170
Hey, boys and girls! Are ya having fun?

07:59.170 --> 08:01.020
It's almost time!

08:02.600 --> 08:04.010
For what?

08:04.010 --> 08:06.330
The Mummy Game!

08:06.330 --> 08:07.960
The... what?

08:07.960 --> 08:09.840
Here are the rules!

08:09.840 --> 08:14.890
In the Mummy Game, you mummify 
your partner in toilet paper,

08:14.890 --> 08:19.390
and the duo that makes the 
best, most complete mummy wins.

08:19.390 --> 08:20.970
H-Huh...

08:20.970 --> 08:22.530
Sounds kinda fun.

08:22.530 --> 08:23.490
Right?

08:23.490 --> 08:25.580
We're all here for a party.

08:25.580 --> 08:27.770
It'd be boring to just eat 
and talk the whole time.

08:28.170 --> 08:30.770
Also, you'll form teams 
of one boy and one girl,

08:30.770 --> 08:33.150
and the boy will mummify the girl.

08:33.150 --> 08:35.160
<i>The boy mummifies the girl?</i>

08:36.410 --> 08:39.980
Yes! Do your best, you louts!

08:39.980 --> 08:42.850
The winning pair gets 
a year's supply of snacks!

08:42.850 --> 08:45.140
Yeah!

08:43.410 --> 08:45.140
<i>Th-This is it!</i>

08:45.140 --> 08:48.920
<i>If we win, I could take a picture with him!</i>

08:49.210 --> 08:53.300
<i>It'd be totally natural, 
and he wouldn't dare delete it!</i>

08:56.050 --> 08:57.760
<i>All right.</i>

08:58.990 --> 09:01.940
Boy-girl pairs, with the boy wrapping the girl?

09:01.940 --> 09:03.850
Never heard of those rules before.

09:03.850 --> 09:04.890
Shh.

09:05.300 --> 09:07.100
Okay, boys, draw your lots.

09:09.410 --> 09:12.860
<i>First, I gotta end up as Medaka's partner.</i>

09:13.970 --> 09:15.060
What number?

09:15.550 --> 09:16.780
Eight.

09:16.780 --> 09:18.280
Eight, huh...

09:19.200 --> 09:21.710
Wh-What's up, Asahi?

09:21.710 --> 09:23.080
N-Not much.

09:23.340 --> 09:26.750
<i>I-Is she tryin' to team up with Medaka too?</i>

09:26.750 --> 09:28.000
<i>I won't lose.</i>

09:28.000 --> 09:30.500
All done. Girls next.

09:34.460 --> 09:36.200
Grab a ball.

09:36.200 --> 09:39.000
I'm so nervous about teaming up with a boy.

09:39.660 --> 09:41.640
Oh, sorry, I knocked the box!

09:45.890 --> 09:50.190
Y'know, a cool upperclassman would let 
the younger kid have it here.

09:50.190 --> 09:54.190
But I want this one. 
I don't want anything else.

09:54.190 --> 09:55.480
Cringe.

09:55.480 --> 09:57.160
Screw trying to look cool.

09:57.160 --> 10:00.320
Asahi, you could show your upperclassman 
some deference here too, y'know?

10:00.320 --> 10:01.180
Don't wanna.

10:01.180 --> 10:04.240
Let. It. Go.

10:04.240 --> 10:05.080
Nope.

10:05.410 --> 10:08.730
<i>Wh-What's with her? She's not even budgin'.</i>

10:08.730 --> 10:10.740
<i>Is this 'cause she plays basketball?</i>

10:10.740 --> 10:12.750
<i>I won't let her have it!</i>

10:13.650 --> 10:16.260
<i>Crap... I can't hold on much longer...</i>

10:19.230 --> 10:21.420
Oh, Kuroiwa-kun!

10:21.420 --> 10:22.050
Huh?

10:26.350 --> 10:27.160
Hey!

10:27.990 --> 10:30.720
What number did you get, Mona-chan?

10:30.720 --> 10:31.550
Eight!

10:31.550 --> 10:33.730
Y-You cheat!

10:34.160 --> 10:37.240
<i>Whew, close call.</i>

10:40.170 --> 10:41.740
Kuroiwa-kun!

10:42.740 --> 10:46.300
<i>Truth told, I'm still not over 
the whole zipper thing, but...</i>

10:46.300 --> 10:47.500
Let's do this.

10:49.530 --> 10:51.980
<i>Now I just gotta win.</i>

10:51.980 --> 10:54.240
<i>We're gonna win this game!</i>

10:54.240 --> 10:57.140
<i>And I'm gonna take that pic with him!</i>

10:58.190 --> 11:00.600
L-Let's do this, Shonan-san.

11:00.600 --> 11:01.760
Sure.

11:02.270 --> 11:05.880
Everyone got their toilet paper rolls?

11:07.140 --> 11:09.640
The Mummy Game starts now!

11:09.640 --> 11:11.660
Go for it, Kuroiwa-kun.

11:11.660 --> 11:12.520
Right.

11:16.080 --> 11:19.150
<i>Far be it from me to miss out 
on a golden photo opportunity!</i>

11:21.580 --> 11:23.500
<i>All right, Medaka.</i>

11:24.700 --> 11:27.050
<i>Come make me a mummy!</i>

11:30.580 --> 11:32.960
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

11:32.960 --> 11:37.960
<b>Let's do this!</b>

11:35.590 --> 11:37.960
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

11:53.230 --> 11:56.610
<i>S-So loose! He's barely wrappin' it around me.</i>

11:57.110 --> 12:01.990
K... Kuroiwa-kun, you need to wrap it 
a bit tighter, or it'll come undone.

12:02.360 --> 12:04.870
<i>E-Easy for her to say.</i>

12:05.240 --> 12:07.370
<i>After what happened earlier...</i>

12:09.390 --> 12:11.280
<i>This is too much.</i>

12:15.740 --> 12:19.130
<i>I-I can feel her shape through the paper.</i>

12:19.130 --> 12:22.720
<i>Every time I put my arms around her, 
I'm this close to touching her.</i>

12:23.170 --> 12:26.490
<i>I-It's just a game. I'll half-ass it.</i>

12:26.490 --> 12:28.760
<i>If it ends up coming undone, whatever.</i>

12:31.700 --> 12:34.000
<i>Gah, so loose!</i>

12:35.810 --> 12:37.140
Wrap faster!

12:37.140 --> 12:38.520
Oh, s-sorry!

12:38.520 --> 12:40.400
<i>We're gonna lose if this keeps up!</i>

12:42.840 --> 12:44.530
I said, tighter!

12:46.130 --> 12:47.570
Let me help.

12:47.870 --> 12:50.080
You gotta go more like this!

12:50.350 --> 12:52.870
<i>I've gotta win. I've just gotta!</i>

12:57.300 --> 12:59.630
There we go. That's better.

12:59.630 --> 13:01.630
Get it now, Kuroiwa-kun?

13:02.290 --> 13:04.670
<i>Now hold on just one second, Tokyo!</i>

13:04.670 --> 13:09.430
<i>What a provocative mummy! 
Why go so far for some stupid game?</i>

13:09.430 --> 13:13.520
My arms need to be covered, too. 
Hurry up with the rest.

13:16.520 --> 13:20.320
Kuroiwa-kun! You can't wrap me up 
if you don't look at me.

13:20.650 --> 13:23.070
<i>C-Clear mind, clear spirit.</i>

13:25.420 --> 13:27.530
<i>I-I can see way too much!</i>

13:27.530 --> 13:29.150
<i>My vision is filled with temptation!</i>

13:29.150 --> 13:32.300
<i>The touch of her skin through 
this paper is temptation, too!</i>

13:33.130 --> 13:37.040
<i>Come on, what's the big problem? 
All you gotta do is wrap some paper around me!</i>

13:37.040 --> 13:38.580
Hurry, Kuroiwa-kun!

13:41.090 --> 13:42.490
I can't!

13:48.070 --> 13:49.140
<i>Wha?</i>

13:52.020 --> 13:54.390
Time's up!

13:54.760 --> 13:58.410
Let's see which pair did the best job.

13:58.410 --> 14:02.400
I, Sho Kobayakawa, promise to be 
the most subjective judge of all time.

14:02.700 --> 14:04.460
The winners are...

14:05.030 --> 14:07.920
the pair of Mobtani and Haruno!

14:07.920 --> 14:09.680
Grats!

14:09.680 --> 14:11.980
Haruno-san, you were really easy to mummify.

14:11.980 --> 14:13.160
Aww...

14:13.160 --> 14:15.790
I... I lost.

14:16.090 --> 14:20.040
Look this way, you two. 
Let's take a photo to remember this.

14:20.040 --> 14:21.680
Here I go.

14:20.040 --> 14:22.540
<b>Winners





One Year's Snack Supply</b>

14:22.810 --> 14:24.170
Let's go one more.

14:24.170 --> 14:26.420
Bigger smile, you two.

14:28.190 --> 14:30.220
<i>Why'd he throw the roll away at the end?</i>

14:30.220 --> 14:34.580
<i>I was gonna win and get that pic for us!</i>

14:34.580 --> 14:38.780
Hey, Kuroiwa-kun. 
Let's take a pic to remember today.

14:39.190 --> 14:40.980
Nah, I...

14:40.980 --> 14:43.250
Hurry up and unwrap me! Faster!

14:43.250 --> 14:44.730
I'm trying!

14:44.990 --> 14:46.740
Say cheese.

14:47.200 --> 14:48.740
I'll send you the pic later.

14:48.740 --> 14:51.130
<i>I... I took a pic with a girl.</i>

14:51.130 --> 14:53.130
<i>M-My tenets...</i>

14:53.130 --> 14:56.870
<i>Oh, so he doesn't mind 
takin' pics with people, huh?</i>

14:56.870 --> 14:58.460
Say cheese!

14:59.220 --> 15:01.370
Kuroiwa-kun, let's take one of us, too.

15:01.640 --> 15:05.170
<i>I bet he's just gonna delete them later anyway.</i>

15:05.170 --> 15:07.420
<i>Just like he deleted mine the other day.</i>

15:07.420 --> 15:09.220
Okay, smile.

15:10.220 --> 15:14.220
<i>C-Cling to him all you want! 
He'll just delete it later!</i>

15:14.220 --> 15:15.720
Say cheese!

15:16.200 --> 15:19.240
<i>H-Hey, you're too close, don'tcha think?</i>

15:19.240 --> 15:22.520
<i>You don't have to get </i>that<i> 
up close and personal, y'know!</i>

15:22.520 --> 15:24.520
I'll take one too!

15:24.520 --> 15:26.330
<i>This is pissin' me off!</i>

15:26.330 --> 15:28.530
D-Do you mind, Kuroi—

15:32.170 --> 15:34.010
I-I'm done!

15:35.170 --> 15:38.330
<i>H-He can't be serious.</i>

15:38.780 --> 15:41.720
Okay, everyone scoot in!

15:42.080 --> 15:46.540
Shorter people in front. Those with hats 
should probably go behind.

15:46.920 --> 15:50.540
Oh, and off with your hood, Medaka-kun. 
Can't tell who you are.

15:53.390 --> 15:54.780
Scoot in!

15:58.360 --> 16:01.940
<i>A group photo is meaningless. 
It's nothing special.</i>

16:02.530 --> 16:08.100
<i>I dolled myself up all so I could give 
Medaka a special pic to take home...</i>

16:08.440 --> 16:10.940
<i>Meanwhile, he's fine with 
takin' pics with others!</i>

16:13.940 --> 16:15.140
Ready?

16:23.540 --> 16:24.480
Dumbass.

16:47.110 --> 16:48.740
What's up, Medaka-kun?

16:49.460 --> 16:51.540
I think Mona-chan's mad at me.

16:52.510 --> 16:54.700
What did you do this time?

16:55.180 --> 16:59.490
She asked to take a photo with me 
at the party yesterday.

16:59.490 --> 17:04.190
But I said no 'cause I was overloaded 
after taking a bunch with other girls.

17:04.190 --> 17:06.460
Then she started acting strange...

17:06.460 --> 17:08.350
Why'd you turn her down?!

17:08.350 --> 17:10.620
Oh, that explains it.

17:11.450 --> 17:12.260
Look.

17:13.610 --> 17:15.090
This group pic.

17:15.500 --> 17:17.160
I knew you two didn't seem right.

17:17.720 --> 17:19.620
She called me a dumbass.

17:19.620 --> 17:21.220
D-Dumbass?

17:21.490 --> 17:25.870
She must've been pretty hurt to resort 
to that. You should apologize.

17:26.590 --> 17:29.420
You must've not let her down gently.

17:29.420 --> 17:32.480
Why the drama over one pic, man? 
Acting like you're some big shot.

17:32.890 --> 17:35.170
I feel so bad for Mona-chan.

17:35.170 --> 17:39.560
Heck, she even wore that witch 
costume just for you, Medaka.

17:39.990 --> 17:43.780
Yeah, all from the goodness of her heart.

17:43.780 --> 17:45.540
And you just ignored all of it.

17:46.170 --> 17:47.900
I-I see...

17:47.900 --> 17:49.960
I really should apologize, then.

17:49.960 --> 17:50.910
Huh?

17:52.180 --> 17:54.840
Whatcha talking about?

17:56.970 --> 18:01.060
Why're you looking away? 
Now's your chance to apologize!

18:01.060 --> 18:03.490
I-I'm not ready yet...

18:03.490 --> 18:05.580
You're acting like a jerk, dude!

18:05.580 --> 18:08.230
Sorry, Mona-chan, give us a minute.

18:11.070 --> 18:13.710
Get back here, Medaka!

18:11.800 --> 18:12.980
S-Some other time.

18:16.760 --> 18:17.740
<i>I...</i>

18:17.740 --> 18:19.960
<i>I've gone and done it now!</i>

18:19.960 --> 18:23.320
<i>It felt like he'd been avoiding me all day...</i>

18:23.320 --> 18:26.990
<i>I bet it's over what happened yesterday!</i>

18:26.990 --> 18:29.750
<i>Ah, what do I do now?</i>

18:32.000 --> 18:34.890
Uh, who sits here?

18:34.890 --> 18:37.050
Nikuyama and Mobtani.

18:37.050 --> 18:40.450
<i>C-Crap. I gotta fix this somehow.</i>

18:40.450 --> 18:42.550
So, about cleaning duty.

18:42.550 --> 18:45.320
We'll go by seating. 
Pair up with your neighbors.

18:45.320 --> 18:46.670
I'll call out the names.

18:46.670 --> 18:48.940
Nakajima and Hayashi 
handle the science prep room.

18:48.940 --> 18:52.440
<i>But how? He's avoiding me...</i>

18:49.340 --> 18:51.930
Mitani and Nikuyama, the home ec. room.

18:52.770 --> 18:55.440
Kuroiwa and Kawai handle 
the Japanese prep room.

18:55.950 --> 18:58.440
The rest clean up the classroom.

18:56.950 --> 18:59.110
<i>Th-That's it!</i>

18:59.110 --> 19:01.610
<b>Japanese Prep Room</b>

19:00.340 --> 19:03.780
Hup, hup, hup.

19:05.790 --> 19:11.210
<i>If I wanna cancel out that failure, 
I gotta overwrite it with even more charm!</i>

19:11.210 --> 19:13.840
You know, I happen to quite enjoy cleaning.

19:14.170 --> 19:16.050
Y-You do?

19:16.050 --> 19:19.550
Hup. Gotta put my back into it!

19:22.180 --> 19:24.360
<i>I... I can almost see...</i>

19:24.980 --> 19:27.210
<i>So, your heart racin' yet?</i>

19:27.210 --> 19:29.680
<i>Forget all about yesterday...</i>

19:30.520 --> 19:32.890
I... I'll clean up a different area.

19:33.710 --> 19:34.990
<i>Huh? Why?</i>

19:35.690 --> 19:37.480
Wait a sec!

19:45.640 --> 19:47.700
Are you okay, Kuroiwa-kun?

19:47.700 --> 19:50.800
S-Sorry. I'm really sorry.

19:50.800 --> 19:53.020
It's fine. My shirt's still dry.

19:53.770 --> 19:55.610
<i>I went and did it again.</i>

19:55.610 --> 19:59.250
<i>I'm such a do-nothin'-right doofus.</i>

19:59.250 --> 20:02.360
<i>Forget fixin' yesterday, 
I only made things worse.</i>

20:02.360 --> 20:04.510
<i>Crud, I think I'm about to cry...</i>

20:06.510 --> 20:11.920
<i>Heck, why was I so ticked off 
yesterday, anyway?</i>

20:11.920 --> 20:15.100
<i>Medaka puttin' up walls is nothin' new.</i>

20:23.450 --> 20:24.700
<b>grr</b>

20:24.230 --> 20:25.370
<i>H-Huh?</i>

20:25.370 --> 20:28.440
<i>I got ticked off all over again. Why?</i>

20:28.910 --> 20:31.440
<i>Anyway, I gotta apologize.</i>

20:37.480 --> 20:39.280
K-Kuroiwa-kun...

20:40.560 --> 20:41.840
Sorry about yesterday.

20:40.560 --> 20:41.840
Sorry about yesterday.

20:44.250 --> 20:47.550
I'm not great with photos.

20:47.950 --> 20:51.040
I didn't turn you down specifically yesterday...

20:53.090 --> 20:54.100
So, you know...

20:54.560 --> 20:56.970
D-Do you get it?

20:56.970 --> 20:57.560
Huh?!

20:57.560 --> 21:00.250
Y-Yeah, I get it! All good!

21:00.250 --> 21:05.070
Also, like, I should apologize 
for getting all pouty, too.

21:10.450 --> 21:12.330
Are you done cleaning yet?

21:12.330 --> 21:14.580
I'll get the teach... Hm?

21:14.830 --> 21:17.310
Huh? You've made zero progress!

21:17.310 --> 21:19.420
And why's the floor wet?

21:19.420 --> 21:21.580
You been goofing off, Medaka?!

21:21.580 --> 21:23.710
E-Er...

