<b>m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100</b>

21:43.610 --> 21:44.610
<b>Lockscreen changed
successfully.</b>

21:50.810 --> 21:52.370
Clear mind, clear spirit.

21:52.370 --> 21:53.370
<b>m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100</b>

21:52.370 --> 21:53.370
<b>Lockscreen changed
successfully.</b>

21:52.370 --> 21:54.120
No women in my space!

22:10.430 --> 22:13.460
I'm comin' for ya, Tokyo!

